---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import Navigation from '../../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CommercialOpportunityMap from '../../components/CommercialOpportunityMap.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f1e9" />
    <meta name="description" content="Commercial opportunity prioritisation case study by Giacomo Di Muro." />
    <title>Commercial Opportunity Prioritisation — Giacomo Di Muro</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <Navigation />

    <main class="co-page">
      <section class="container co-hero">
        <a class="co-back" href="/#work">← Selected work</a>

        <div class="co-hero-grid">
          <div class="co-hero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">01 / 03 · Commercial Strategy</p>
            <h1>Commercial Opportunity Prioritisation</h1>
            <p class="co-client">Global beverage company</p>
          </div>

          <aside class="co-hero-meta" aria-label="Project overview">
            <div class="co-scale">
              <strong>12k+</strong>
              <span>locations analysed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="co-meta-row">
              <span>Geography</span>
              <b>Italy · 9 markets</b>
            </div>
            <div class="co-meta-row">
              <span>Focus</span>
              <b>Commercial prioritisation</b>
            </div>
            <div class="co-capabilities" aria-label="Capability areas">
              <span>Commercial Strategy</span>
              <i>·</i>
              <span>Market Analytics</span>
              <i>·</i>
              <span>GTM</span>
              <i>·</i>
              <span>Decision Support</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-question-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>01</span>
          <p>Business question</p>
        </div>
        <div class="co-question-copy">
          <h2>Which commercial opportunities should be prioritised?</h2>
          <p>A large network contains very different commercial opportunities. The challenge was to bring market, commercial, competitive and contextual information into a consistent basis for comparison and action.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-context-grid">
        <div class="co-context-statement">
          <p class="eyebrow">Context</p>
          <h2>Not every location represents the same strategic or commercial opportunity.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="co-context-copy">
          <p>Thousands of locations had to be viewed through a common analytical lens while preserving differences across territories and local market conditions.</p>
          <p>The goal was not to create another dashboard, but to build a structured decision-support layer that could make opportunities easier to compare and prioritise.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-approach-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span>02</span>
            <p>Approach</p>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro">A simple analytical sequence moved the work from fragmented signals to a more consistent prioritisation view.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="approach-flow">
          <li>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Frame the network</h3>
            <p>Structure the commercial perimeter and relevant market context.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Read market signals</h3>
            <p>Combine commercial, competitive and territorial information.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Assess potential</h3>
            <p>Support sales-potential and profitability-oriented assessment.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>Compare opportunities</h3>
            <p>Create a consistent basis for relative prioritisation.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>05</span>
            <h3>Translate into action</h3>
            <p>Turn findings into management-ready decision support.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-analysis-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span>03</span>
            <p>Analytical work</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-heading-copy">
            <h2>From locations to a comparable opportunity view.</h2>
            <p>The visuals below reconstruct the analytical logic with synthetic data. They show the type of reasoning behind the work without exposing client information or proprietary scoring formulas.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <CommercialOpportunityMap />

        <div class="artifact-grid">
          <article class="artifact artifact-matrix">
            <div class="artifact-head">
              <div>
                <p class="artifact-kicker">Opportunity matrix</p>
                <h3>Compare markets on two commercial dimensions.</h3>
              </div>
              <span>Synthetic reconstruction</span>
            </div>

            <div class="matrix-wrap" aria-label="Illustrative opportunity matrix">
              <div class="matrix-y-label">Market attractiveness</div>
              <div class="matrix-area">
                <div class="quadrant q1"><span>Build selectively</span></div>
                <div class="quadrant q2"><span>Prioritise</span></div>
                <div class="quadrant q3"><span>Context / monitor</span></div>
                <div class="quadrant q4"><span>Targeted plays</span></div>

                <span class="matrix-point p-milan" title="Milan">Milan</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-rome" title="Rome">Rome</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-bari" title="Bari">Bari</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-florence" title="Florence">Florence</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-bologna" title="Bologna">Bologna</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-turin" title="Turin">Turin</span>
                <span class="matrix-point p-venice" title="Venice">Venice</span>
              </div>
              <div class="matrix-x-label">Commercial potential</div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="artifact artifact-logic">
            <div class="artifact-head">
              <div>
                <p class="artifact-kicker">Prioritisation logic</p>
                <h3>Multiple signals, one decision-support view.</h3>
              </div>
              <span>Illustrative</span>
            </div>

            <div class="logic-flow">
              <div class="logic-inputs">
                <div>
                  <span>01</span>
                  <strong>Commercial</strong>
                  <small>potential · economics</small>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <span>02</span>
                  <strong>Market</strong>
                  <small>attractiveness · competition</small>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <span>03</span>
                  <strong>Context</strong>
                  <small>territory · local signals</small>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="logic-connector" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b>→</b></div>
              <div class="logic-output">
                <span>Opportunity assessment</span>
                <strong>Comparable commercial priorities</strong>
                <p>A structured basis for targeting and management decisions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-contribution-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>04</span>
          <p>My contribution</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contribution-grid">
          <div class="contribution-lead">
            <h2>Turning analysis into commercial decision support.</h2>
            <p>My role focused on analytical and commercial problem solving within the broader project team.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="contribution-list">
            <div>
              <span>01</span>
              <p>Supported the analytical structure used to assess and compare commercial opportunities.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>02</span>
              <p>Performed market and competitor analysis and supported go-to-market assessment.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>03</span>
              <p>Contributed to revenue / sales-potential estimation and profitability-oriented thinking.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>04</span>
              <p>Translated findings into prioritisation and management-ready decision-support outputs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="co-decision-band">
        <div class="container co-decision-grid">
          <div class="section-label light-label">
            <span>05</span>
            <p>Decision enabled</p>
          </div>
          <div class="decision-copy">
            <h2>A clearer basis for deciding where commercial attention should go first.</h2>
            <p>The analysis helped make opportunities comparable across markets and provided a structured basis for targeting, commercial prioritisation and management discussion.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="decision-list">
            <li><span>01</span> Compare opportunities consistently</li>
            <li><span>02</span> Identify commercially attractive areas</li>
            <li><span>03</span> Support targeting and GTM priorities</li>
            <li><span>04</span> Translate analysis into action-ready outputs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-evidence-section">
        <div class="section-heading evidence-heading">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span>06</span>
            <p>Evidence</p>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro">Selected facts that show the scale and nature of the work.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="evidence-grid">
          <div class="evidence-primary">
            <strong>12k+</strong>
            <span>locations analysed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="evidence-item">
            <strong>9</strong>
            <span>Italian markets in scope</span>
          </div>
          <div class="evidence-item">
            <strong>4</strong>
            <span>signal families: commercial, market, competitive, contextual</span>
          </div>
          <div class="evidence-item text-evidence">
            <strong>Decision support</strong>
            <span>Management-ready prioritisation outputs</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="confidentiality-note">Client identity, source data and proprietary formulas are not shown. Visual reconstruction uses synthetic data for confidentiality.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="container co-next-project">
        <span>Next project</span>
        <a href="/work/retail-performance">
          <div>
            <p>02 / 03</p>
            <h2>Retail Performance Intelligence</h2>
          </div>
          <b>→</b>
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .co-page {
    padding-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .co-back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: clamp(42px, 6vw, 78px);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .72rem;
  }

  .co-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(52px, 6.5vw, 92px);
  }

  .co-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.65fr) minmax(300px, .65fr);
    gap: clamp(54px, 8vw, 130px);
    align-items: end;
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 8vw, 108px);
  }

  .co-hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6.15vw, 6.3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    line-height: .9;
  }

  .co-client {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .94rem;
  }

  .co-hero-meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .co-scale {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 25px 0 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .co-scale strong {
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 5vw, 5.3rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -.07em;
    line-height: .85;
  }

  .co-scale span,
  .co-meta-row span {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .67rem;
  }

  .co-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .co-meta-row b {
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .co-capabilities {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .67rem;
  }

  .co-capabilities i {
    color: #afb5b0;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 180px;
  }

  .section-label span,
  .section-label p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .62rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .section-label span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .co-question-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 2fr) minmax(0, 8fr);
    gap: 34px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 9vw, 130px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .co-question-copy h2 {
    max-width: 930px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.7vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
    line-height: .96;
  }

  .co-question-copy > p {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 30px 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .94rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .co-context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(300px, .75fr);
    gap: clamp(50px, 9vw, 150px);
    padding-top: clamp(70px, 8vw, 115px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(70px, 8vw, 115px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .co-context-statement h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 3.8vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .co-context-copy {
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  .co-context-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .co-context-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .co-approach-section,
  .co-analysis-section,
  .co-contribution-section,
  .co-evidence-section {
    padding-top: clamp(70px, 8vw, 112px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(70px, 8vw, 112px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 2fr) minmax(0, 8fr);
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 66px);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 670px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .section-heading-copy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(250px, .8fr);
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .section-heading-copy h2 {
    max-width: 710px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 3.7vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .section-heading-copy p {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .83rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .approach-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .approach-flow li {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 240px;
    padding: 25px 24px 26px 0;
  }

  .approach-flow li:not(:last-child) {
    margin-right: 24px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .approach-flow li > span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .approach-flow h3 {
    margin: 76px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .approach-flow p {
    max-width: 190px;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .artifact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .artifact {
    min-height: 510px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: rgba(251, 250, 246, .68);
  }

  .artifact-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .artifact-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .artifact-head h3 {
    max-width: 430px;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.7vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .artifact-head > span {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .58rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .matrix-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 52px;
    padding: 0 0 26px 32px;
  }

  .matrix-area {
    position: relative;
    height: 285px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, transparent calc(50% - .5px), var(--border-light) 50%, transparent calc(50% + .5px)),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent calc(50% - .5px), var(--border-light) 50%, transparent calc(50% + .5px));
  }

  .quadrant {
    position: absolute;
    width: 50%;
    height: 50%;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .quadrant span {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .56rem;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .q1 { left: 0; top: 0; }
  .q2 { right: 0; top: 0; background: rgba(220, 231, 222, .34); }
  .q3 { left: 0; bottom: 0; }
  .q4 { right: 0; bottom: 0; }

  .matrix-point {
    position: absolute;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(14, 86, 63, .08);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .58rem;
  }

  .matrix-point::after {
    content: attr(title);
    position: absolute;
    left: 15px;
    top: -4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .p-milan { left: 76%; top: 22%; }
  .p-rome { left: 68%; top: 32%; }
  .p-bari { left: 61%; top: 44%; }
  .p-florence { left: 56%; top: 29%; }
  .p-bologna { left: 49%; top: 39%; background: var(--accent-medium); }
  .p-turin { left: 42%; top: 49%; background: var(--accent-medium); }
  .p-venice { left: 36%; top: 61%; background: #aebcb2; }

  .matrix-x-label,
  .matrix-y-label {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: .58rem;
  }

  .matrix-x-label {
    margin-top: 10px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .matrix-y-label {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);
    transform-origin: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .artifact-logic {
    background: #10271e;
    color: var(--light);
  }

  .artifact-logic .artifact-kicker,
  .artifact-logic .artifact-head > span {
    color: rgba(244, 247, 243, .46);
  }

  .logic-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 330px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .logic-inputs {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .logic-inputs > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 4px 14px;
    padding: 17px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 247, 243, .1);
  }

  .logic-inputs span {
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    color: rgba(244, 247, 243, .4);
    font-size: .58rem;
  }

  .logic-inputs strong {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .logic-inputs small {
    color: rgba(244, 247, 243, .52);
    font-size: .62rem;
  }

  .logic-connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    width: 42px;
  }

  .logic-connector i {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(244, 247, 243, .18);
  }

  .logic-connector b {
    color: rgba(244, 247, 243, .58);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .logic-output {
    padding: 26px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 247, 243, .14);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(244, 247, 243, .035);
  }

  .logic-output > span {
    color: #a9c9b6;
    font-size: .61rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .logic-output strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    line-height: .98;
  }

  .logic-output p {
    margin: 25px 0 0;
    color: rgba(244, 247, 243, .55);
    font-size: .69rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .co-contribution-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 2fr) minmax(0, 8fr);
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .contribution-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(60px, 8vw, 120px);
  }

  .contribution-lead h2 {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 3.8vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    line-height: .98;
  }

  .contribution-lead p {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: .83rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .contribution-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .contribution-list > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .contribution-list span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: .62rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contribution-list p {
    margin: 0;
